<navigation-bar title="饮食记录" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view><view slot="right" class="report-shortcut" bindtap="openReport"><view class="mini-report"><view></view></view></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="records-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-shell records-page">
  <view wx:if="{{saved}}" class="saved-banner"><view class="saved-check"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><text>本餐已保存到今日记录</text><view class="saved-close" bindtap="closeSaved"><view></view></view></view>
  <view class="date-header"><view class="month-row"><view class="month-arrow prev"></view><text>2024年7月27日</text><view class="month-drop"></view><view class="month-arrow next"></view></view><view class="date-grid"><view class="date-cell {{item.active ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{dates}}" wx:key="day" bindtap="chooseDate" data-day="{{item.day}}"><text>{{item.week}}</text><view class="day-number">{{item.day}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.day === 22 || item.day === 24 || item.day === 26}}" class="meal-dot"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="meal-list"><view class="meal-card ui-card" wx:for="{{meals}}" wx:key="type"><view class="meal-time"><view class="time-icon {{item.tone}}"></view><text class="meal-type">{{item.type}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text></view><image src="/assets/meal-banner-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill" style="object-position: {{item.position}}"></image><view class="meal-copy"><text class="meal-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="meal-ingredients">{{item.ingredients}}</text><view class="tag-row"><text wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:key="*this" class="meal-tag">{{tag}}</text></view></view><view class="chevron"></view></view></view>
  <view class="summary-card ui-card"><view class="score-summary"><text>今日饮食评分</text><view><text class="summary-score">88</text><text>分</text></view><view class="stars"><view wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4]}}" wx:key="*this" class="star-css"></view><view class="star-css off"></view></view></view><view class="category-summary"><text class="category-title">食物种类统计</text><view class="category-grid"><view><text class="category-number">6</text><text>种蔬菜</text></view><view><text class="category-number">3</text><text>种肉蛋</text></view><view><text class="category-number">2</text><text>种谷物</text></view><view><text class="category-number">1</text><text>种水果</text></view></view></view><view class="summary-tip"><view class="bulb"></view><text>宝宝的饮食种类还可以更丰富，明天试试深色蔬菜和水果。</text></view></view>
</view></scroll-view>
<view class="floating-add" bindtap="addMeal" aria-role="button" aria-label="新增饮食记录"><view></view></view>
<app-tabbar active="records" showCamera="{{true}}"></app-tabbar>
